    <div class="home">
        <div class="intro">
            <div class="wrap">
                <h2>Welcome to Phoenix Bio-Medical</h2>
                <p>We specialize in delivering expert biomedical engineering and technology services tailored to the unique needs of rural and specialty healthcare facilities. Our services are designed to help your organization remain compliant, reduce downtime, and extend the life of your equipment. </p>
                <a class="btn" href="/about">More About Us</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="services bg-light">
            <div class="wrap">
                <h2>Bio-Medical Engineering Services</h2>
                <div class="grid half">
                    <a href="/equipment" onclick="return false">
                        <img width="600" height="400" loading="lazy" src="/images/services-preventative-upkeep.jpg" alt="Doctors reviewing documents in a medical office" />
                        <h3>Preventative Upkeep, Safety Checks &amp; Inspections</h3>
                        <p>Regular checks and upkeep ensure your medical devices function safely and dependably throughout their operational lifespan.</p>
                    </a>
                    <a href="/equipment" onclick="return false">
                        <img width="600" height="400" loading="lazy" src="/images/services-portable-ventilator.jpg" alt="Portable ventilator in an intensive care unit" />
                        <h3>Swift Repairs: Routine, Scheduled &amp; Urgent Services</h3>
                        <p>Swift repairs for critical equipment breakdowns and routine maintenance to address normal wear and tear on medical devices. </p>
                    </a>
                    <a href="/equipment" onclick="return false">
                        <img width="600" height="400" loading="lazy" src="/images/services-medical-equipment.jpg" alt="Modern devices for neurosurgery in an operating room" />
                        <h3>Inventory Verification &amp; Equipment Valuation</h3>
                        <p>Thorough audits and assessments for regulatory adherence, insurance purposes, or determining resale value of medical equipment.</p>
                    </a>
                    <a href="/equipment" onclick="return false">
                        <img width="600" height="400" loading="lazy" src="/images/services-clinical-engineering.jpg" alt="Biomedical engineers testing medical equipment in a lab" />
                        <h3>Clinical Engineering Program Management</h3>
                        <p>Thorough equipment lifecycle oversight, including documentation, monitoring, and detailed reporting services.</p>
                    </a>
                    <a href="/equipment" onclick="return false">
                        <img width="600" height="400" loading="lazy" src="/images/services-used-medical.jpg" alt="Stethoscope and money resting on graphs of data" />
                        <h3>Sales &amp; Procurement of Used Medical Equipment</h3>
                        <p>High-quality used medical equipment available for purchase or trade-in, promoting cost-efficiency and environmental responsibility.</p>
                    </a>
                    <a href="/equipment" onclick="return false">
                        <img width="600" height="400" loading="lazy" src="/images/services-doctor-shaking-hands.jpg" alt="Doctor shaking hands with older patient in a clinic room" />
                        <h3>Contact Phoenix Bio-Medical Equipment Services</h3>
                        <p>We would love to answer any questions you may have. Please reach out by phone, email, or use our contact form to send a message.</p>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
